## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

The Nodeless Breez API key must be set for the SDK to work. You can request one for free by filling the form at: <https://breez.technology/request-api-key/#contact-us-form-sdk>

**Note:** This is not the same as the Native (Greenlight) Breez API key, so it can't be reused.

