### LNURL-Auth

```javascript
const lnurlAuthUrl = 'lnurl1dp68gurn8ghj7mr0vdskc6r0wd6z7mrww4excttvdankjm3lw3skw0tvdankjm3xdvcn6vtp8q6n2dfsx5mrjwtrxdjnqvtzv56rzcnyv3jrxv3sxqmkyenrvv6kve3exv6nqdtyv43nqcmzvdsnvdrzx33rsenxx5unqc3cxgeqgntfgu'

